# WLMDB Coding Instructions

**MANDATORY — only when the task involves writing, editing, or reviewing code:**

1. Use the **Glob** tool with pattern `*.md` in `.github/instructions/` to discover all instruction files.
2. Use the **Read** tool to read every file returned by the Glob search.
3. Do NOT start coding until every instruction file has been read. This applies to every new chat session.

Skip this step for non-coding tasks such as answering questions, explaining concepts, or general conversation.
